    completed_at: "2026-07-31T20:31:45.685Z"
  - id: plan-step-002
    order: 2
    title: Implement generic bounded subscription collection and normalized entity deltas
    status: completed
    created_at: "2026-07-31T20:22:04.252Z"
    updated_at: "2026-07-31T20:31:47.715Z"
    evidence: "Added reusable bounded collection with early max-event termination and unsubscribe cleanup, subscribe_entities server filters, expanded initial rows, and lossless add/change/remove patches. Focused transport/command tests and live built CLI pass."
