    updated_at: "2026-07-31T20:37:44.845Z"
    evidence: "Exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage (116 files, 1294 tests); 100% docstrings (123/123 files); typecheck, ESLint, duplication threshold, <=300 code-line gate, ShellCheck, Bun audit, Trivy, build, exhaustive compiled help, setup/settings coverage, six-format live E2E, entity deltas, and trigger/condition catalogs all passed. No private payloads persisted."
    completed_at: "2026-07-31T20:37:44.845Z"
