    evidence: Latest pm-cli 2026.7.31 and pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1 installed and pinned; generated CHANGELOG is deterministic; strict PM validation and health are clean after runtime cache clear; graph audit has zero findings across 67 nodes and 223 edges; clean-worktree auto-release dry-run reached terminal success with full release verification and isolated npx plus bunx package smoke tests without publishing.
    completed_at: "2026-07-31T20:44:14.705Z"
